# Where the registration form sends its POST request.
#
# - Local development (`npm run dev`): leave empty. The app defaults to the
#   bundled local API at http://localhost:8765/api/register.
# - Production build: leave empty unless an approved HTTPS endpoint exists.
#   With no URL the form runs in "local confirmation" mode: it validates in the
#   browser and shows a confirmation, but sends personal details NOWHERE.
VITE_REGISTRATION_API_URL=
